601
00:18:58,520 --> 00:19:00,560
We'll keep it very simple.

602
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:01,360
Let's do this.

603
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:02,520
We point it out, okay?

604
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:03,400
Point on three, two, one.

605
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,120
Who are you picking?

606
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:04,720
Then take each other's

607
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:05,760
