608
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,360
(Requesting a pause)
Wait a moment. Hold on.

609
00:19:07,560 --> 00:19:08,240
Who do you think it is?

610
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,360
(Your opponent is displeased)
Haven't you finished discussing yet?

611
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:10,880
Not yet.

612
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:11,640
We haven't finished discussing.

613
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:13,200
We were taking a break just now.

614
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,360
(Definitely not eavesdropping)
We had some tea.

615
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:14,840
No need to discuss.

616
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:15,720
We ordered some coffee.

617
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:16,440
Let's point together.

618
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:19,160
(Stalling for time)
Both people pick one person, right?

619
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:20,640
Let's pick Lin Yi.

620
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,480
Lin Yi?

621
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,384
