622
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:23,320
Come on.

623
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:24,440
Who goes first?

624
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,120
We go together.

625
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:26,000
Let's talk first.

626
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:26,760
Let's talk.

627
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:27,840
(Probing)
Lin Yi, is it you?

628
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:28,920
