641
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:44,160
No.

642
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,120
Do it the simple way.

643
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,480
On three, two, one,
you both point at one person,

644
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,320
and they both point at one person too.

645
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:48,040
And the two who get pointed at

646
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:49,640
will step forward
and pop each other's balloons.

647
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:50,040
Right.

648
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:50,680
Come on.

649
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:51,080
Come on.

650
00:19:51,122 --> 00:19:53,516
(Silently observing)

651
00:19:55,120 --> 00:19:57,360
Wang Yuwen has
a very serious expression.

652
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:57,960
