653
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,080
She might be faking it.

654
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:00,800
Otherwise, she'd pretend to be relaxed.

655
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,080
(Confirming opponent's queen is Lin Yi)
Lin Yi, okay?

656
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:02,760
Okay.

657
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:03,040
Come on.

658
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:06,440
Turn, point at each other,
and shout a name.

659
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,920
Wow The World!

660
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:09,720
(Finalizing slogan)
Whoever is right here, okay?

661
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:10,280
Okay.

662
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:10,960
Come on.

663
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:12,520
