Three, two, one.

664
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:14,280
- Wow The World!
- Wow The World!

665
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,600
- Lin Yi is right here!
- Lin Yi is right here!

666
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:21,040
- Sun Honglei is right here!
- Sun Honglei is right here!

667
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:23,680
Come on, Lin Yi versus Sun Honglei.

668
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:24,680
Pop it.

669
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:28,080
Spin around.

670
00:20:28,785 --> 00:20:33,017
(Duel vibes at maximum)

671
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:35,920
Okay.

672
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:38,160
(Loves stirring up trouble)
End of episode, cue commercial.

673
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:41,320
(Both players swap balloons)

674
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:41,640
Okay.

675
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,040
