Yuwen.

696
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:16,920
I survived.

697
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:18,840
Great job.

698
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:19,160
Nice.

699
00:21:19,160 --> 00:21:19,720
Awesome.

700
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:21,320
We've outwitted you.

701
00:21:21,320 --> 00:21:22,440
(Allow us a little moment of pride)

702
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,320
When it comes to Old Maid,

703
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:25,320
